# 28_noise_sleep_bed.ledc — AM-Noise Sleep Bed (SMOOTH), ~30 min — sleep masking + slow drive
# Technique: playbook A6 "AM-noise carrier". Broadband pink noise gated slowly at 0.85 Hz
#            (delta / sleep-onset range) gives a wide, low-fatigue drive that also masks
#            environmental sound. This is the SMOOTH variant — sine amplitude modulation
#            (the audio default env, a gentle swell). A crisper pulsed (trapezoid) variant
#            is 29_noise_sleep_pulsed.ledc.
# Bands: pink-noise AM at 0.85 Hz (sleep-onset delta); brown-noise steady warm bed; light steady.
#
# Engine caveat: this build's AM depth is fixed (~0.1), so the swell is gentle, not the
#   "deep depth" of the reference — a deeper burst awaits the firmware trapezoid/depth work.
#
# SAFETY / CONTRAINDICATIONS:
#   Do NOT use if you have photosensitive epilepsy, a seizure disorder, or a history of
#   photic migraine. Do not use while driving. Experiential, not medical.
#   The light is STEADY (freq 0, no flicker) and dim warm amber (no strobe, no saturated-red
#   flicker); brightness ramps in 15 s and fades to 0; noise volumes fade in over 60 s and
#   fade out at the end (never abrupt). A sleep bed — ends dark + silent, no wake-up.
#
# LED columns : time freq duty bright R G B mask   (freq 0 = steady warm amber, mask 255)
# Audio cols  : A time freq pan vol mod [ch] [freq_r] [wave]   (wave 5 pink, 6 brown; mod = AM Hz)
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (the >/* prefix sits where a segment BEGINS).

# --- Settle (00:00-01:00): dim amber steady light + noise fade-in ---
0 0 100 >0 255 90 0 10           # LED steady dim amber; brightness fade-in from 0
A 0 200 0 >0 0.85 1 0 5           # ch1 pink noise, smooth 0.85 Hz sine AM; vol fade-in
A 0 100 0 >0 0 2 0 6              # ch2 brown noise, steady warm bed (no AM); vol fade-in
S 3000 default 47 "Settling in. Let the soft rush of sound carry you toward sleep."
15000 0 100 12 255 90 0 10        # brightness reaches 12% (dim; >=10 s ramp-in)
A 60000 200 0 90 0.85 1 0 5        # ch1 pink vol settled 45
A 60000 100 0 60 0 2 0 6           # ch2 brown vol settled 30

# --- Hold (01:00-28:00 = 27 min): steady dim light + AM pink bed + brown warmth ---
S 600000 default 47 "Breathing slow. Nothing to do now but drift."

# --- Soft Off (28:00-30:00): brightness + both noise beds fade to 0 (no wake-up) ---
1680000 0 100 >12 255 90 0 10     # LED brightness ramp-out START 12 ...
A 1680000 200 0 *90 0.85 1 0 5     # ch1 pink quad fade 45->0
A 1680000 100 0 *60 0 2 0 6        # ch2 brown quad fade 30->0
S 1680000 default 47 "The sound is fading now. Let go completely. Sleep."
1800000 0 100 0 255 90 0 10       # end: brightness 0 (dark)
A 1800000 200 0 0 0.85 1 0 5       # end: pink vol 0
A 1800000 100 0 0 0 2 0 6          # end: brown vol 0 (silent)
